{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
R: Jesus have it [Bb]all, Jesus have it [Dm]all
To You belongs the [C]glory
The praise of all the [Gm]world
Jesus have it [Bb]all, Jesus have it [Dm]all
All blessing and all [C]honor, all majesty and [Gm]awe
Jesus have it [Bb]all ([Dm]Jesus have it [C]all [Gm])
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
3.Jesus have Your [F]Church, Your love, Your bride
The joy for which You [C]freely gave Your life
Radiant in [Gm]white, washed and puri[Bb]fied
Jesus have us [F]all
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
4. Jesus have Your [F]worth, Your due, Your sum
The praise of every [C]nation, tribe and tongue
Let all that has been [Gm]made, glorify Your [Bb]Name
Jesus have it [F]all
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge}
All my [Bb]days, all my [Dm]life
Have it [C]all[Gm]
{end_of_bridge}

{title: Let it rain}
