{start_of_chorus}
[C] One way, [G]Jesus
[Am7] You're the only one that [F]I could live for
[C] One way, [G]Jesus
[Am7] You're the only one that [Bb]I could live for 
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[Am7] [F] [Am7] [F]

[C] You are always, always there
[Am7] Every how and every where
